{
  "version": "1.0",
  "vertical": "dc2_s",
  "_doc": "Data-centre hardware/channel motion. thermal_escalation's floor is 'high', not the design note's 'critical': the structural floor for infra_incident (signal_engine.json urgency.structural_by_role) is 'high', so a structured incident row never reaches 'critical' and the playbook would never fire on the CSV lane (the guard-never-fires class).",
